467
00:38:07,440 --> 00:38:07,800
Yes.

468
00:38:07,800 --> 00:38:08,400
Okay.

469
00:38:08,400 --> 00:38:09,160
Let's go.

470
00:38:09,160 --> 00:38:09,680
Yes.

471
00:38:09,680 --> 00:38:10,920
