479
00:38:35,880 --> 00:38:38,280
please come to Fou4Mod’s fanmeet.

480
00:38:40,840 --> 00:38:42,840
Please take good care of Fou4Mod!

481
00:38:42,840 --> 00:38:44,160
please come to Fou4Mod’s fanmeet.

482
